<mart. 7.97.3>	Auli municipem mei Pudentis,
<mart. 7.97.4>	Illi tu dabis haec uel occupato:
<mart. 7.97.5>	Instent mille licet premantque curae,
<mart. 7.97.6>	Nostris carminibus tamen uacabit:
